<title>UK: Denmark sets 200 mln SFR seven-year FX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 200 mln SFR seven-year FX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark has launched a 200 million Swiss franc seven-year bond whose redemption value is linked to the franc's performance, lead manager Merrill Lynch said Monday.</p>
<p>The minimum redemption will be par. An additional payment will be made if any of the dollar, mark or sterling appreciate against the franc during the life of the bond. That payment will, in percentage terms, equal the largest appreciation.</p>
<p>* * *</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    12.FEB.04</p>
